Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[" Section 5.1", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"cbf858b3-72f3-4ea6-b571-63c798de719a"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox[" Motion In Time And Space\n Conservation Of Mass II",
 FontWeight->"Bold"]], "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"4e33aa12-9543-47b9-bfb7-\
7a237492a815"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{" ", 
  RowBox[{"Remove", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", " ", "]"}], " "}]], "InputOnly",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.398445197235862*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[1555]:=",ExpressionUUID->"850ebf82-c1e9-4999-a82c-8b9d81aa4672"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Introduction:", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"406a5d88-7442-4987-bf4c-904c47c39edf"],

Cell["\<\
Models which incorporate more than one independent variable (for example both \
space and time), lead in a natural way to PDEs rather than an ODEs.

Assume that a substance moves along some medium which is identified with the \
x-axis (for example, heat along a rod, cars moving down a highway, pollutants \
down a river, etc. etc.).

It is our purpose to extend basic conservation principles to both space and \
time.  Even though the quantity being conserved could be many different \
things, we will consider the special case of conservation of mass.

Let \[Rho][x,t] be the density or concentration of the substance at location \
x and time t (in units of mass per unit distance).

Let q[x,t] be the rate of flow past location x at time t (in units of mass \
per unit time).
q > 0 is interpreted to mean that the net flow is from left to right.

Let k[x,t] be the net rate which the density of the sources or sinks is \
changing at location x and time t (in units of mass per unit distance per \
unit time).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"50977797-0598-4586-9348-4086ebc92846"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The basic conservation principal states:\n",
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]], "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->\
"e82dcc3d-2f44-45fd-97a3-942aeae04e4b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The time rate of increase of mass within an interval of length \
\[CapitalDelta]x ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 "\n\t",
 StyleBox["= ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["The net rate of flow across the boundaries of that interval\n\t",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox["+",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox["\nAny source terms and less any sink terms\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"407d895e-da62-458b-858b-6fcc9797cffd"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The time rate of increase of mass within an interval \
of length \[CapitalDelta]x :\n",
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.4651491793395576`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"bb52a9b9-94a4-46b1-8563-\
fdd8320f1775"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "10675266-78f2-4f4f-b0c3-af9510ecdbd6"],
 "  = The mass within an interval of length \[CapitalDelta]x\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    FractionBox["d", "dt"],
    FontSize->16,
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "32a17f59-14fc-4d0c-a6f0-500a6e032e5c"],
 "( ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c3587325-f77b-40d6-bd86-94ea9727b1e6"],
 ")  = The time rate of increase of mass within an interval of length \
\[CapitalDelta]x\n"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"79254ec5-ac02-45c6-ae6b-ea5ce853afd9"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The net rate of flow across the boundaries of that \
interval:\n",
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.4651491804490395`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3bdcd1e1-7341-41ae-b8d9-\
21539906aaf7"],

Cell["\<\
q[x,t]  =  rate of flow across the boundary of the interval at x
\t(enters the interval from left to right)
q[x + \[CapitalDelta]x,t]  =  rate of flow across the boundary of the \
interval at x + \[CapitalDelta]x
\t (exits the interval from left to right)
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c0599a4d-1ee1-47c4-a02d-6094acac7bc1"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Any source terms and less any sink terms",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox[":\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.4651491815116415`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"18b51293-ea34-4d1a-b974-\
bcd4b3f07a49"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"k", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ca40da71-5d9c-4770-8090-f4446ef6fbc6"],
 "  =  (source terms - sink terms)\n"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9724cf25-3b4f-4d4a-b957-e902cdddb07c"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The basic conservation principal:\n",
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}]], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.465149183246183*^9},ExpressionUUID->"603122fe-7a7b-4283-a698-\
b7e43bcd8993"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rate of accumulation  =  Flux in  - Flux out  +  Net source and sink\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    FractionBox["d", "dt"],
    FontSize->16,
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4870defa-96c7-4d39-980e-d6c1be0342e5"],
 "( ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c9a99395-3869-4413-b106-3336c6c28b43"],
 ")  =  q[x,t]  -  q[x + \[CapitalDelta]x,t]  + ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
      RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"k", "[", 
       RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
      RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"11a8d20c-8b64-4f80-8038-fadf6f92e1f0"],
 "\n\n However the rate of accumulation becomes:\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    FractionBox["d", "dt"],
    FontSize->16,
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6b3caf18-5309-4abc-ba08-35d96dc9629a"],
 "( ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1d6e049d-cb46-436c-a239-33d2092fab6e"],
 ")  =  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
      RowBox[{"(", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}]}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "43b49701-1d32-43a4-8761-7c7b8cf4e145"],
 "\n\n The flux in -  flux out becomes:\n q[x,t]  -  q[x + \
\[CapitalDelta]x,t]  =  - ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
      RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"q", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", ")"}]}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "41f0c7de-d2a6-47f4-8e36-5d12066f7b9f"],
 "\n \n The net source and sink term becomes:\n ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
      RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"k", "[", 
       RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
      RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"5aa83dbd-af2c-40e7-8133-67150a8e5c55"],
 "\n\n Thus, the full conservation law becomes:\n ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
      RowBox[{"(", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}]}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b3ef0a25-8d90-4fb2-930d-5fa611a86e0c"],
 " =  - ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
     RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
      RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
       RowBox[{"q", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", ")"}]}], 
     RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eea37397-058d-4fe9-92f0-c846ec304990"],
 "  + ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
      RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"k", "[", 
       RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], 
      RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"b4d360b2-1d7d-4df8-ad1d-dbb08904a6b4"],
 "\n \n  Move all integrals to lhs:\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "x", 
      RowBox[{"x", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]x"}]], "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
         RowBox[{"(", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
           RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}]}], "  ", "+", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
         RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"q", "[", 
           RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", ")"}]}], "  ", "-", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"k", "[", 
         RowBox[{"s", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "s"}]}]}], "  ", "=", "  ", "0"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b0a1377c-bcb5-4c13-b686-421b0415993a"],
 "\n\nSince the above integral must be 0 for every interval ( x, x + \
\[CapitalDelta]x), then the expression inside must be equal to 0 at all times \
and at all locations.\n\n ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
    RowBox[{"(", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"b2bb230b-60ba-43db-8d3c-d70883d840b1"],
 "  +  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
     RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"q", "[", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"722094d0-7a52-4860-add8-99e78fa8fce5"],
 "  -  k[x,t]  =  0\n "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7504252065258255`*^9, 
  3.7504252142545986`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd71943a-9760-4ef6-b2cb-\
10f15a40a2b1"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
 The PDE form of our basic conservation law becomes (of 1-space-dimension):
\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.465149184621315*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f10a266d-2c20-437a-b7bc-\
10262cf07093"],

Cell[TextData[{
 " Rate of accumulation  =  Flux in  - Flux out  +  Net source and sink\n     \
    ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
    RowBox[{"(", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"55bc42d6-f453-4dc5-83e0-26aaf8f1b3c5"],
 "           =      -",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
     RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"q", "[", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"3d5286b1-2e1c-4d68-aaed-d39acbf6ef40"],
 "     +           k[x,t]  "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"11afae3f-5971-4732-93ed-68560ce54942"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Examples:", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d0fb0f70-ff1f-4d2d-8120-efd7f603b3e1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Example: Flux by Transport", "Subsubsection"],
 "\nConsider the following illustration of flux crossing the left boundary \
and accumulating in the region from 0 to 5.\n\tx Interval = { 0, 5 }\n\tflux \
= by transport\n\tnet source = 0\nCarefully observe that the rate of \
accumulation is related to the rate of flux across the left boundary (i.e. to \
the function \"q[0]\") and to the rate of flux across the right boundary \
(i.e. to the function \"q[5]\")."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"70b33a98-98ed-45b2-896d-f111c7054aa3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"flux", "[", 
   RowBox[{"x_", ",", "t_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  FractionBox["1", 
   RowBox[{"1", "+", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"x", "-", "t"}], ")"}], "2"]}]]}]], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1556]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8ef8001f-fb5b-4670-b027-9f1e8d715524"],

