Cell[TextData[{
 "Observe that the flux across the left boundary and the right boundary are \
both positive because the fluid motion is from left to right.  \n",
 StyleBox["\nExample: Flux by Transport\n                Net Rate of \
Accumulation\n", "Subsubsection"],
 "The following example better illustrates the rate of change in the total \
accumulated volume relative to influx from the left and out flux to the right."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"963ee84c-d43c-4433-896a-503da91f71ac"],

