   3.39845846713*^9, 3.398458483656*^9}, {3.398458549816*^9, 
   3.3984585762200003`*^9}, {3.3984587086730003`*^9, 3.398458713222*^9}, {
   3.398459034645*^9, 3.398459047257*^9}, 3.398459102417*^9, 
   3.398459142158*^9, 3.3984592730629997`*^9, {3.39845938721*^9, 
   3.3984593975620003`*^9}, {3.398459437264*^9, 3.39845944927*^9}, 
   3.398459990367*^9, {3.398460058179*^9, 3.398460109288*^9}, {
   3.398460142414*^9, 3.3984601682139997`*^9}, {3.398460285101*^9, 
   3.398460309031*^9}, 3.3984603655699997`*^9, {3.398460414459*^9, 
   3.398460555635*^9}, {3.398460589587*^9, 3.39846061426*^9}, {
   3.398460658781*^9, 3.398460750225*^9}, {3.398462091645*^9, 
   3.398462115308*^9}, 3.3984621696070004`*^9, {3.3984622406429996`*^9, 
   3.398462250736*^9}, {3.398462327343*^9, 3.398462360658*^9}, {
   3.398462619925*^9, 3.3984626682790003`*^9}, {3.3984627837060003`*^9, 
   3.3984627855*^9}, 3.398462823612*^9, {3.398463165821*^9, 
   3.398463189174*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[1616]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3e185f91-eb1e-4a4a-9193-0003db79bcc1"],

Cell["\<\
Observe that initially, heat enters very quickly.  However, for longer times, \
the rate of heat entry slows (at least for this particular problem).

The total accumulated heat in our rod segment can be better illustrated in \
the following graph vs. time:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fe9c2d66-03ed-4e5f-b7c3-5faa733f79fe"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tempTotal", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", "150"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1617]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4218ec3a-0a55-4b3a-b938-e5b456df86a6"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Total Flux:", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c9b58f26-c196-4671-8b51-66a875c2d1ef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "More generally, if both advection and diffusion are present, then the total \
flux is the sum of these individual terms:\n\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["q", 
    RowBox[{" ", "Total"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "402d367f-3764-41ec-8824-736e3ac017a3"],
 "  =  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["q", "Advection"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2cef3b9d-c628-432d-ba4c-508152dcfd05"],
 "  +  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["q", "Diffusion"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0ddee83f-f073-40a7-8744-bfef86c307ca"],
 "\n\t\n\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["q", 
    RowBox[{" ", "Total"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2b030eb6-f891-441a-b8e7-7b58294a54e1"],
 "  =  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", "u"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6a5a31c4-2687-4bea-88be-9596ec0d3498"],
 "    -   \[Nu]   ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "\[Rho]", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b2cd700e-73d8-463a-91e3-e420c71a6390"],
 "\n\n\nThe resulting PDE corresponding to both advection and diffusion is:\n\
\n Rate of accumulation  \t=             Flux in  - Flux out\t\t\t+  Net \
source and sink\n\t ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
    RowBox[{"(", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], " ", ")"}], "  "}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"49929257-b2c9-4c09-938f-30f2a3ebd108"],
 "\t\t=  -",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
     RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
         RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "  ", 
        RowBox[{"u", "[", 
         RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], "   ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Nu]", "   ", 
        FormBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], ")"}]}],
         TraditionalForm]}]}], " ", ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"50132953-8705-46ca-bc79-ecd44636b667"],
 "\t+          k[x,t]  \n \t     ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "t"], 
    RowBox[{"(", " ", "\[Rho]", " ", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"d428e67a-79c5-4f52-bfea-2051bb238061"],
 "  \t\t=          -",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "x"], 
     RowBox[{"(", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "  ", "u"}], " ", ")"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"c122a5f1-4893-418f-8533-7d183cb46d0f"],
 "  +   \[Nu] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "xx"], 
     RowBox[{"(", " ", 
      FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ")"}],
       TraditionalForm], " "}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "41baf857-c441-4364-bbb0-f4bbbedc174c"],
 "  \t\t+            k"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6064a3ad-1304-463c-ba30-d664813b1b2e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Source Terms:", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"e256aab5-e055-494c-9ea1-f98a7efa3bb8"],

Cell["\<\
Source terms \"k[x,t]\" represent all remaining mechanisms other than flux.  \
For the heat flow problem, typical source terms might include chemical \
reactions, heat of formation, etc. etc.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f7299093-43cc-45ac-9ab8-6f09bc7c7b2b"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Summary:", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"9c7d23dc-8dcc-4372-921a-f113d83518c8"],

Cell["\<\
A practical consideration for modeling is to attempt to view every \
conservation problem in terms of diffusion and advection flux along with the \
source terms.  The basic idea is to determine how much transport (i.e. \
advection) and uneven distribution (i.e. diffusion) contribute to the total \
flux term.  For many problems, one of the two types of flux dominates the \
other sufficiently so that the minor mechanism can be ignored, thereby \
significantly simplifying the PDE.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b1dde4b-1bbd-400a-9555-b8db5df1e2e4"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]]
},
